      "prompt": "PRESS E TO TALK",
      "messages": [
        "\\\"FOUR ISLANDS, FOUR\\nCOLOURS OF CRYSTAL.\\n\\nI'VE MAPPED THREE.\\nNOBODY COMES BACK FROM\\nMIDNIGHT WITH A STEADY\\nENOUGH HAND TO DRAW IT.\\\"",
